<p>This document is the specification of a vocabulary and provides a shared conceptual framework for certain concepts.</p>
<p>On 04/10/2018, this document was published as a Standard by the OSLO Data Standards working group, ratified by the Flemish Information and ICT Policy Steering Body on 03/07/2018.
This standard has the status of 'voluntary application'.</p>

